<title>JAPAN: Biwako Bank says to write off losses in 1996/97.</title>
<headline>Biwako Bank says to write off losses in 1996/97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biwako Bank Ltd said on Wednesday that it would write off losses incurred as a result of the alleged misappropriation of funds by a former employee in the current 1996/97 business year.</p>
<p>A bank official said that the bank found out that an employee had misappropriated funds totalling 3.4 billion yen on October 16 and reported the incident to police on October 22.</p>
<p>The bank has yet to file a complaint but plans to do so after completing its investigation, he said.</p>
<p>Another bank official said the bank has not completed its investigation but said some 400 million yen could be recovered.</p>
</text>
